+/**
+ * The work the patched parts of `micromark` and `micromark-core-commonmark` do, by counter, over
+ * every document parsed since this module loaded: one registry, which micromark's patched modules
+ * count into too, through this package's entry. A test reads it before and after a parse to hold
+ * each part to the length of the document.
+ *
